    </blockList>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[Stoolball is ideal for schools – a team sport adaptable to almost any environment, quick to set up and pack away, easy to learn yet teaching plenty of important skills. That’s why the UK National Curriculum for 2009-11 cited it as a good striking and fielding sport at ages 11-16.]]></Value>
